- Update to 2.3.0:
  * mcp_types code, tests and dependency set are unchanged from 2.2.0;
    this subproject is version-locked to the python-sdk monorepo tag (the
    SDK requires "mcp-types=={{ version }}"), so the bump only keeps the
    two in step
  * the 2.3.0 changes are all in the mcp SDK proper, which this package
    does not build; nothing in the wire types changed

